# Engineering

Add tests for important business logic. Financial and position operations need especially strong coverage.

Each phase must remain lint-clean and production-buildable.

Do not add dependencies unless the current work requires them.

Do not create files that are not required by the current request or phase.

When a change affects architecture, migrations, or deployment, update the relevant file in `docs/`.
